					<description><![CDATA[In reply to &lt;a href=&quot;https://uncommoncore.co/unpacking-bitcoins-social-contract/#comment-185&quot;&gt;Skip&lt;/a&gt;.

haha i don&#039;t think i summed up much... but if you mean thanks to @hasu, then yes, totally agreed!  i sent this article to close relations because i thought it did so well.

i watched a documentary in which they tracked down a satoshi (or an s nakamoto? i forgot) living a few blocks from where some of the cryptographers discussing early btc ideas were meeting in the bay area... i&#039;d be surprised if satoshi was the person&#039;s name who came up with btc

